---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Mohammed Fathi: cybersecurity, SOC experience, and HTB CPTS preparation.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm Mohammed</h1>
      <p>Cybersecurity engineer based in Paris, France.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I just finished my MSc in Cybersecurity and AI at EFREI. Before that, I spent
        1 year and 9 months as a Cybersecurity operator apprentice at Vistory SAS working on all things SIEM and monitoring (Splunk Entreprise & ELK Stack), Linux & AD administration and automation (python, ansible, bash, powershell)
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm now going deeper on the offensive side by preparing for the Hack The Box CPTS
        (Certified Penetration Testing Specialist). Understanding how attacks work makes me a better
        defender, and the reverse is true too.
      </p>

      <dl class="facts">
        <dt>Location</dt>
        <dd>Paris, Île-de-France, France</dd>
        <dt>Education</dt>
        <dd>MSc Cybersecurity and AI, EFREI</dd>
        <dt>Experience</dt>
        <dd>SOC operator apprenticeship, Vistory (1 year 9 months)</dd>
        <dt>Working on</dt>
        <dd>HTB CPTS certification (in progress)</dd>
        <dt>Languages</dt>
        <dd>English, French</dd>
      </dl>

      <!--
        EDIT ME: add the things you want visitors to know, for example a "Skills" section,
        tools you use, other certifications, or a short "outside of work" paragraph.
        Check the "Languages" line above and change it to match your real languages.
      -->
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
